e country now are  number one to get brexit done and to  come out of the EU and what we've heard  tonight is that there's going to be yet  more delay unacceptable delay there is  no need to extend the brexit process in  the way that we're seeing I think it's a  great shame that we've missed the  opportunity to come out at No Deal and I  as I say I think it is bitterly  disappointing that the climax of the  brexit process is now being entrusted to  Jeremy Corbyn and the Labour Party with  the result that were almost certainly  going to remain in the customs union

